<title>HUNGARY: Graboplast to sell own shares on bourse.</title>
<headline>Graboplast to sell own shares on bourse.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian home improvement product maker Graboplast Rt announced it had given an order (to a brokerage) for the sale via the Budapest Stock Exchange of 4,730 own ordinary shares.</p>
<p>The statement, dated January 27, was published in Tuesday's official bourse gazette.</p>
<p>On Monday Graboplast shares closed at 8,785 forints, down 105.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
